# Functions currently over the complexity limits, frozen at their present numbers.
#
# Format: <path> | <function> | <metric: cc|nesting> | <count> | <reason>
#
# cc = cyclomatic complexity (limit COMPLEXITY_LIMIT, default 15); nesting = block
# depth relative to the function body (limit NESTING_LIMIT, default 5). Same four-way
# contract as function-size.allow: growth, a new offender, an unrecorded shrink and a
# stale freeze all fail. docs/code-quality-tooling.md#shell-complexity-code-complexity
